        {"zh": "河边风比屋里凉", "en": "The river wind is cooler than indoors."},
        {"zh": "渔具都还在这儿", "en": "The gear's all here."},
        {"zh": "这房子总算有了样子", "en": "The house finally looks like a home."},
        {"zh": "我先把网补好", "en": "I'll mend the net first."},
